NBA Trivia (20-0) — sources & licences

Design    Built from the "20-0 v2" screens of the "Mobile app design decisions" design project, on the Modernist
          design system retuned dark with an orange accent (modernist.css + app.css).
Code      index.html (screen markup), app.js (screen logic), dc.js (renderer). Question bank and engine in data/
          (engine.js, questions.js, mystery.js, teams.js, facts.js), carried over from the design project unchanged.
Fonts     Archivo (The Archivo Project Authors / Omnibus-Type), SIL Open Font License 1.1; files and licence in fonts/.
Images    None. The three photo areas (welcome, home team card, team hub) are empty until images are set in
          SLOT_IMAGES in app.js. No team or league logos are used; teams appear as three-letter text marks.
Data      NBA facts are used for trivia reference only. Games, teams and players from balldontlie (balldontlie.io),
          1946-47 to the present; awards table hand-checked. Accounts, stats, leaderboards and head-to-head live in
          Supabase (supabase/migrations); guests and offline play fall back to the device. supabase-js 2.118.0 (MIT)
          is vendored in vendor/.

Live      https://nba-trivia-20-0.netlify.app (Netlify project nba-trivia-20-0; data in Supabase).
Run       Serve this folder over HTTP (ES modules don't load from file://), e.g.  python3 -m http.server  and open
          index.html.
